	(text "POWER: +12V -> D2 -> +12V_F (output op-amps; R1||R2 16.5R -> Q1 BCP56 (U1A LM358 loop, ref U9 REF5050) -> +5VA; FB2 + R3 -> U2 TPS562208 FCCM buck -> L1 -> +3V3 -> FB1 -> +3V3_C -> R21 -> +3V3_OSC); -12V -> D1 -> -12V_F. +12 V ~0.34 A max, -12 V ~20 mA."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 33.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4 1.4)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "11c34441-2dc6-5db6-895e-33f63b71ef28")
	)
	(text "+3V3 BUCK, kept out of the audio (D7):\n- only the digital rail is switched; +5VA (codec VCC, input op-amps)\n  stays linear from +12V_F\n- U2 is the FCCM TPS562208: fixed ~580 kHz at every load, it never\n  pulse-skips into the audio band (TPS562201 would: do not substitute)\n- FB2 + R3 2.2R + C6/C7 keep its switching current off +12V_F\n  (output op-amps, +5VA regulator, U9) and off the Eurorack bus\n- L1 molded (shielded); FB1 filters the codec VDD, R21/C43 the clock\n- layout: C6/C8-U2 loop tight, small SW node, buck in the power corner\n  away from the inputs and the codec analog pins, solid GND under it"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 116.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "37428055-9311-563f-bb9a-44785933715e")
	)
	(text "BIG MODULAR USB-AUDIO-MAX - carrier (jack board), S2. 6 in / 8 out, DC-coupled +/-5.9 V, no level controls, PCM3168A 24-bit, up to 96 kHz. Circuit intent: docs/research.md"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "39d6ee81-f238-5f2f-bce9-c9bbfe9c6a47")
	)
	(text "OUTPUTS (x8): VOUTn+/- (8 Vpp differential around VCOMDA) -> difference amplifier on +/-12 V\n(15k / 22k || 47p, gain 1.467) -> 2k || 2k (1k / 0.5 W) -> jack. Full scale +/-5.87 V, DC-coupled:\nthe common mode (VCOMDA) cancels, so the outputs stay near 0 V while the DAC powers up or mutes."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 246.38 142.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "764af303-a38d-5f46-919b-f33ceacea893")
	)
	(text "DC REFERENCE: +5VA sets the gain of every channel (DAC 1.6 x VCC, ADC 0.2 x VCC), so it is a precision rail:\nU9 REF5050A (0.1 %, 8 ppm/C) -> R6 10k / C19 1u -> V5_SET -> U1A LM358 -> R9 -> Q1 BCP56 -> R8 -> +5VA;\nR7 10k senses +5VA at the codec; C37 22n + R16 47k = PI compensation. Q2 limits at ~0.3-0.35 A (R8 2.2R).\nCalibration removes the fixed offset and gain errors; this keeps them from drifting."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 185.42 45.72 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "78b8b082-c0a1-5c68-8fc6-d795530c7688")
	)
	(text "PCM3168A INTERFACE: I2C 0x44 (MODE = DGND, ADR1/ADR0 = 0). ADC = clock master, 24-bit I2S-mode TDM;\nDAC = slave on the same BCK/LRCK (pins tied). SCKI 24.576 MHz: 96 kHz = 256 fS (dual rate, BCK 128 fS),\n48 kHz = 512 fS (single rate, BCK 256 fS): BCK = 12.288 MHz in both. 96 kHz: DOUT1 ADC1-4, DOUT2 ADC5-6,\nDIN1 DAC1-4, DIN2 DAC5-8. 48 kHz: DOUT1 ADC1-6, DIN1 DAC1-8. Firmware: SEAD = 1 (single-ended),\nBYP = 111 (HPF off, DC), REVAD = 1 (inverting drivers), offsets calibrated per channel."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 330.2 38.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "8116c441-9bc6-5da0-864e-eda042ca30b1")
	)
	(text "REFERENCES (+5VA): U6C buffers VCOMAD -> VCOM_BUF -> 100R / 10u -> VCOM_REF (VIN1-6 -);\nVCOM_BUF x 100/124 -> U6D -> VB_IN (input drivers). Both track the codec mid-rail."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 375.92 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "a03bb939-db77-5419-9e6e-702bb5a49024")
	)
	(text "PWR_FLAG: GND/+12V/-12V at J1; +12V_F/-12V_F behind D2/D1; V5_IN behind R1||R2; V3_IN behind FB2 + R3; +3V3 behind L1 (buck); +5VA at R8 (discrete regulator); +3V3_C behind FB1; +3V3_OSC behind R21."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 154.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "a1c0e897-367e-5951-a2a2-8f3ce2e82591")
	)
	(text "INPUTS (x6): jack (TN = GND) -> 100k -> inverting driver on +5VA (-0.24, + at VB_IN) -> 470R / 2.2n C0G\n-> VINn+ (single-ended mode; VINn- = VCOM_REF). +/-5.89 V = 1 Vrms ADC full scale. 100k input impedance."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 167.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "ba7081c4-64b9-5a63-9cff-c3fb966da030")
	)
	(text "MCU BOARD LINK: J2/J3 1x10 2.54 mm male headers (plastic on the carrier F side);\nthe MCU board (usb-audio-max-mcu) solders on top. BOOT/RESET and SWD on the carrier (B side):\nhold BOOT, press RESET = CH32V307 ROM bootloader on the USB-C."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 579.12 50.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "f3b88476-a88e-5f39-bc1c-fb7f3f3ed294")
	)
